{"articleNo":"55326","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=55326&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"“경북그린에너지 프론티어기업 발굴·육성사업” 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.16","hit":"4384","attachments":[{"name":"사업공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=55326&attachNo=70317"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 14.9pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">경북 동해안지역을 신재생에너지산업의 거점지역으로 육성하고, 관련 기업의</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">기술실용화를 촉진하기 위하여 다음과 같이 “경북 그린에너지 프론티어기업 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">발굴·육성사업</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">”을 시행하오니</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 참여를 원하는 사업자는 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 14.9pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 사업개요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">□ 사업목적</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">기 개발된 R&amp;D 성과물의 사업화 유도를 통한 매몰비용 절감</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">원천기술 개발 및 응용？융합기술 개발, 상품화기획(디자인？마케팅)의</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">Package형</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;기술개발사업을 통한 성공적인 시장진입 지원</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">상용화 가능한 기술 및 아이템의 개발을 지원하여 지역경제 활성화 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 및 고용 창출 유도</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">□ 사업기간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>실용과제 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012.05.01 ~ 2013.04.30(12개월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>선도과제 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 2012.05.01 ~ 2014.04.30(24개월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2. 지원대상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">□ 지원분야(붙임 참조) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>지정공모(선도과제) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 대통령직속 녹색성장위원회 선정 ‘27대 중점기술’ 중 10개 분야</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>자유공모(실용과제) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;: 신재생에너지 분야 內 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">기타 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">친환경적인 에너지 이용을 위한 관련설비의&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 개발, 제조, 설치 및 에너지 저감기술</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">□ 주관 및 참여기관</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>주관기관 : 경상북도 소재 기업 및 예비창업자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">경상북도 소재기업 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">선정평가위원회 개최일 이전까지 경상북도 내로 사업장</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 등록 기업 포함</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 예비창업자 : 대학·연구소의 Spin-Off 기업 및 신기술보유 사업자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>참여기관 : 경상북도 소재 대학, 연구소, 기업</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">참여방식 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">기업단독 또는 주관·참여기관의 공동개발팀(산-학, 산-연, 산-산)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">□ 우대사항(최대 7점 이내)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span>사업공고일 6개월 이전부터 선정평가위원회 개최일까지 경상북도로</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사업장 이전(지사 형식으로 신규사업장 등록기업 포함) 기업(5점)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">총사업비의 20% 이상 현금 Matching 기업(2점)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">포항TP의 중개를 통하여 이전 받은 기술을 사업화하고자 하는 기업(2점)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 지원내용 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\